<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<Defs>

  <!--
    ANGELIC — what it is like to stand in a room with a god.

    Social-situational, the same machinery as vanilla's Pretty: every humanlike
    who knows them and can see carries the opinion while the godhood trait is
    carried. +50 is deliberately past the top of the beauty ladder (stunning is
    +40) — this is not "very pretty", it is a different category of thing, the
    face gone magnificently androgynous and the hair gone white.

    NO nullifyingTraits, unlike Pretty (Ascetic, Kind). An ascetic can decline
    to care that someone is handsome; declining to notice an ascended being is
    not a temperament, and Kind pawns are not "seeing past" anything — there is
    nothing unkind in awe.

    Worker checks sight on the observer (blind pawns keep their own counsel)
    but deliberately NOT disfigurement on the god — a scar does not dent
    divinity. See ThoughtWorker_Angelic.
  -->
  <ThoughtDef>
    <defName>IsekaiDungeons_Angelic</defName>
    <thoughtClass>Thought_SituationalSocial</thoughtClass>
    <workerClass>IsekaiDungeons.ThoughtWorker_Angelic</workerClass>
    <validWhileDespawned>true</validWhileDespawned>
    <stages>
      <li>
        <label>angelic</label>
        <baseOpinionOffset>50</baseOpinionOffset>
      </li>
    </stages>
  </ThoughtDef>

</Defs>
